<title>USA: TABLE-BMC West Q2 EPS off, more shares out.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BMC West Q2 EPS off, more shares out.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 6/30	6 Mos ended 6/30</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	 $190,616    $193,022    $337,385    $340,621</p>
<p> Cost of Sales    147,129     150,772     259,608     265,287</p>
<p> Gross Profit	43,487	42,250	77,777	75,334</p>
<p> SG&amp;A		  35,832	33,087	67,745	62,713</p>
<p> Other Income	   427	   244	   891	   981</p>
