<p> Income Before Taxes 5,720	6,396	 6,473	 7,635</p>
<p> Income Taxes	 2,260	 2,524	 2,557	 3,013</p>
<p>Net Income before</p>
<p>   item		 3,460	 3,872	 3,916	 4,622</p>
<p> Extraordinary item    --	 (342)	    --	 (342)</p>
<p> Net Income	   3,460	 3,530	 3,916	 4,280</p>
<p> Net EPS		  .29	   .38	   .33	   .46</p>
