<p>NOTE: Full co name BMC West Corp.</p>
<p>Q2 EPS $0.29, down from $0.35 (after the $0.03 effect of the write-off related to early repayment of debt) a year ago.</p>
<p>EPS affected by 18 percent more common and common equivalent shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
